13	- Supported Minecraft versions:
14	
15	| Version | Java | Mappings | Notes |
16	|---|---|---|---|
17	| 26.1 (default for new mods) | 25 | None. 26.x is unobfuscated and uses official names. | Start from the current NeoForge generator or MDK for that exact version. |
18	| 26.3 | 25 | None. | Same as 26.1. Check the NeoForge changelog for API changes since 26.1. |
19	| 1.21.1 | 21 | Mojang mappings plus Parchment. | NeoForge 21.1.x. Classes use `ResourceLocation`, not `Identifier`. |
20	
21	- In an existing repo, the version is whatever `gradle.properties` says. Never change it, or any dependency version, unless asked.
